#, php-format
msgid "%d total crawler records accumulated. View your AI visibility trends:"
msgstr "累计 %d 条爬虫记录。查看 AI 可见度趋势："

msgid "Open Dashboard →"
msgstr "打开仪表盘 →"

msgid "WooCommerce is not active. Product-related features (product search, product feed, product AI score) are disabled. Blog and page content is still discoverable by AI. Install WooCommerce for full product AI visibility."
msgstr "WooCommerce 未激活。产品相关功能（产品搜索、产品信息流、产品 AI 评分）已禁用。博客和页面内容仍可被 AI 发现。安装 WooCommerce 以获取完整的产品 AI 可见度。"

msgid "Your site is now visible to ChatGPT and AI assistants."
msgstr "你的网站现已对 ChatGPT 和 AI 助手可见。"

msgid "Open Dashboard"
msgstr "打开仪表盘"

msgid "Dismiss"
msgstr "关闭"

msgid "Rate us on WordPress.org"
msgstr "在 WordPress.org 上评价我们"

msgid "Wizard"
msgstr "向导"

msgid "Close — will re-appear after 8 hours"
msgstr "关闭 — 8 小时后将再次出现"

msgid "Check Your Products"
msgstr "检查你的产品"

msgid "Enter a SKU in the Product AI Score card below to see which products need improvement for AI discovery."
msgstr "在下方产品 AI 评分卡片中输入 SKU，查看哪些产品需要改进以提升 AI 发现率。"

msgid "Connect to ChatGPT"
msgstr "连接到 ChatGPT"

msgid "Copy this link and add it to ChatGPT — then you can search your own products to verify everything works."
msgstr "复制此链接并添加到 ChatGPT — 然后你可以搜索自己的产品来验证一切是否正常。"

msgid "Copy"
msgstr "复制"

msgid "Improve Product Pages"
msgstr "优化产品页面"

msgid "AI prefers products with clear descriptions, images, and categories. Use the score card below to find what to fix."
msgstr "AI 偏好具有清晰描述、图片和分类的产品。使用下方的评分卡找出需要改进的地方。"

msgid "Watch AI Activity Grow"
msgstr "观察 AI 活动增长"

msgid "When customers ask AI about products you sell, their search terms and crawler visits will appear here on your dashboard."
msgstr "当顾客向 AI 询问你销售的产品时，他们的搜索词和爬虫访问将显示在此仪表盘上。"

msgid "Dismiss anytime."
msgstr "可随时关闭。"

msgid "Unauthorized"
msgstr "未授权"

msgid "Settings saved."
msgstr "设置已保存。"

