msgstr "Claude、Gemini、Copilot、Meta AI、Bedrock — 仅限 Pro"

msgid "AI Growth Progress"
msgstr "AI 增长进度"

msgid "Track your progress toward full AI visibility. Complete all 5 milestones for maximum discoverability."
msgstr "追踪全面 AI 可见度的进度。完成全部 5 个里程碑以获得最佳可发现性。"

msgid "Store Live"
msgstr "店铺上线"

msgid "AI Discovered"
msgstr "AI 已发现"

