msgid "💡 How to read this"
msgstr "💡 如何解读"

msgid "Each API call = an AI assistant connected to your site."
msgstr "每次 API 调用 = 一个 AI 助手连接了你的网站。"

msgid "Each crawler visit = an AI search engine indexed your content."
msgstr "每次爬虫访问 = 一个 AI 搜索引擎索引了你的内容。"

msgid "More activity → better AI visibility → more organic traffic."
msgstr "更多活动 → 更好的 AI 可见度 → 更多自然流量。"

msgid "AI activity will appear here as ChatGPT and other AI assistants discover your store. Copy your connection config from the Settings tab and paste into ChatGPT to get started."
msgstr "当 ChatGPT 和其他 AI 助手发现你的店铺时，AI 活动将显示在此处。从设置标签复制连接配置并粘贴到 ChatGPT 即可开始。"

msgid "AI activity will appear here as ChatGPT and other AI assistants discover your site. Copy your connection config from the Settings tab and paste into ChatGPT to get started."
msgstr "当 ChatGPT 和其他 AI 助手发现你的网站时，AI 活动将显示在此处。从设置标签复制连接配置并粘贴到 ChatGPT 即可开始。"

msgid "Check the Analytics tab for detailed trends and top search terms"
msgstr "查看分析标签获取详细趋势和热门搜索词"

msgid "AI-Driven Traffic"
msgstr "AI 驱动的流量"

msgid "Visitors who found your site through AI platforms like ChatGPT, Perplexity, and Copilot."
msgstr "通过 ChatGPT、Perplexity 和 Copilot 等 AI 平台找到你网站的访客。"

msgid "Connect more AI platforms in Pro to increase AI-driven traffic"
msgstr "在 Pro 中连接更多 AI 平台以增加 AI 驱动的流量"

msgid "AI Crawler Activity"
msgstr "AI 爬虫活动"

msgid "Track when AI crawlers like GPTBot and ClaudeBot visit your site. More visits = better AI visibility."
msgstr "追踪 GPTBot、ClaudeBot 等 AI 爬虫何时访问你的网站。更多访问 = 更好的 AI 可见度。"

msgid "Share your content regularly — AI crawlers return more often to sites that update frequently"
msgstr "定期分享内容 — AI 爬虫会频繁回访更新活跃的网站"

msgid "How You Compare"
msgstr "与你对比"

msgid "See how your AI visibility stacks up against other free users and Pro subscribers."
msgstr "查看你的 AI 可见度与其他免费用户和 Pro 用户的对比。"

