msgstr "Pro 用户平均得分 82+ — 升级以解锁 6 个 AI 平台和始终在线连接"

msgid "AI Search Activity"
msgstr "AI 搜索活动"

msgid "See what consumers are asking AI assistants about your content. Shows search terms, results, and timing."
msgstr "查看消费者向 AI 助手询问关于你内容的哪些问题。显示搜索词、结果和时间。"

msgid "No AI searches today yet. When a consumer asks an AI (like ChatGPT) about your products, the search terms and matched products will appear here — so you can see what consumers are asking AI about your store."
msgstr "今天尚无 AI 搜索。当消费者向 AI（如 ChatGPT）询问你的产品时，搜索词和匹配产品将显示在此 — 你可以看到消费者向 AI 询问你店铺的哪些内容。"

msgid "No AI searches today yet. When a consumer asks an AI (like ChatGPT) about your content, the search terms and matched items will appear here — so you can see what consumers are asking AI about your site."
msgstr "今天尚无 AI 搜索。当消费者向 AI（如 ChatGPT）询问你的内容时，搜索词和匹配条目将显示在此 — 你可以看到消费者向 AI 询问你网站的哪些内容。"

