msgid "Check individual product readiness for AI discovery. Enter SKU or name to see a scored breakdown."
msgstr "检查单个产品对 AI 发现的就绪程度。输入 SKU 或名称查看评分详情。"

msgid "Enter SKU or product name"
msgstr "输入 SKU 或产品名称"

