msgstr "输入产品 SKU 或名称查看其 AI 就绪评分。分数越高，AI 越可能向购物者推荐该产品。"

msgid "Use the editor S2LL Score panel for detailed per-product optimization"
msgstr "使用编辑器 S2LL 评分面板进行详细的产品级优化"

msgid "This feature requires WooCommerce."
msgstr "此功能需要 WooCommerce。"

msgid "Install WooCommerce to unlock: product AI scoring, search by price/category/stock, and product feed XML."
msgstr "安装 WooCommerce 以解锁：产品 AI 评分、按价格/分类/库存搜索和产品信息流 XML。"

msgid "Install WooCommerce →"
msgstr "安装 WooCommerce →"

msgid "Settings"
msgstr "设置"

msgid "Configure which features are active. All changes take effect immediately."
msgstr "配置哪些功能处于激活状态。所有更改立即生效。"

msgid "Enable"
msgstr "启用"

msgid "Enabled — store is visible to AI agents"
msgstr "已启用 — 店铺对 AI 代理可见"

msgid "Product Search"
msgstr "产品搜索"

msgid "Enabled — AI can search your catalog"
msgstr "已启用 — AI 可以搜索你的目录"

msgid "Analytics"
msgstr "分析"

msgid "Disabled — no data sent"
msgstr "已禁用 — 不发送数据"

msgid "Enabled — share anonymized site metadata &amp; AI crawler visits for analytics"
msgstr "已启用 — 分享匿名站点元数据和 AI 爬虫访问用于分析"

msgid "When enabled, basic site metadata and AI crawler visits are sent to our cloud service. No personal customer or order data is transmitted. Privacy Policy: https://shop2llm.com/privacy"
msgstr "启用后，基本站点元数据和 AI 爬虫访问将发送到我们的云服务。不会传输任何客户或订单个人数据。隐私政策：https://shop2llm.com/privacy"

msgid "AI Badge"
msgstr "AI 徽章"

msgid "Show — display AI Discoverable badge on your site"
msgstr "显示 — 在网站上展示 AI 可发现徽章"

msgid "Hidden"
msgstr "隐藏"

