msgstr "在页脚添加小徽章表明你的网站可被 AI 发现。链接到 /ai-visibility/ 公开页面。"

msgid "Entity Checks"
msgstr "实体检查"

msgid "Enable external knowledge graph checks (Wikidata/Wikipedia)"
msgstr "启用外部知识图谱检查（Wikidata/维基百科）"

msgid "This sends your focus query to public APIs to check entity presence. No personal data is transmitted."
msgstr "此功能将你的焦点查询发送到公共 API 以检查实体存在。不会传输个人数据。"

msgid "Cart & Checkout"
msgstr "购物车与结账"

msgid "Pro"
msgstr "Pro"

msgid "AI agents add to cart, checkout, and track orders"
msgstr "AI 代理添加到购物车、结账和追踪订单"

msgid "Enable Entity Checks for more accurate AI visibility scores"
msgstr "启用实体检查以获取更准确的 AI 可见度评分"

