msgstr "将你的网站连接到 ChatGPT 和其他 AI 工具。复制粘贴此配置使你的内容可被 AI 访问。"

msgid "Status"
msgstr "状态"

msgid "Paste this config into your ChatGPT to verify your store is AI-ready. This connects your ChatGPT to your store — a quick way to confirm everything works."
msgstr "将此配置粘贴到 ChatGPT 以验证你的店铺是否 AI 就绪。这会将你的 ChatGPT 连接到店铺 — 快速确认一切正常。"

msgid "Paste this config into your ChatGPT to verify your site is AI-ready. This connects your ChatGPT to your site — a quick way to confirm everything works."
msgstr "将此配置粘贴到 ChatGPT 以验证你的网站是否 AI 就绪。这会将你的 ChatGPT 连接到网站 — 快速确认一切正常。"

msgid "💡 Consumers can't search your store yet. This config only connects your own ChatGPT. For consumers to discover your products through ChatGPT, Claude, Gemini and more, you need the always-on cloud connection — available in Pro."
msgstr "💡 消费者尚无法搜索你的店铺。此配置仅连接你自己的 ChatGPT。要让消费者通过 ChatGPT、Claude、Gemini 等发现你的产品，需要始终在线的云连接 — Pro 版可用。"

msgid "💡 Consumers can't search your site yet. This config only connects your own ChatGPT. For consumers to discover your content through ChatGPT, Claude, Gemini and more, you need the always-on cloud connection — available in Pro."
msgstr "💡 消费者尚无法搜索你的网站。此配置仅连接你自己的 ChatGPT。要让消费者通过 ChatGPT、Claude、Gemini 等发现你的内容，需要始终在线的云连接 — Pro 版可用。"

msgid "Copy Config"
msgstr "复制配置"

msgid "Then: ChatGPT Desktop → Settings → Developer → Connect App → paste and save."
msgstr "然后：ChatGPT 桌面版 → 设置 → 开发者 → 连接应用 → 粘贴并保存。"

msgid "👋 First time here? Copy the config above → paste into ChatGPT → your store goes live"
msgstr "👋 首次使用？复制上方配置 → 粘贴到 ChatGPT → 你的店铺即上线"

msgid "👋 First time here? Copy the config above → paste into ChatGPT → your site goes live"
msgstr "👋 首次使用？复制上方配置 → 粘贴到 ChatGPT → 你的网站即上线"

